{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And he said</b> — the meaning: Zerubbabel son of Shealtiel, for he is the anointed one, because he is mashiach to sit upon the throne of Israel, as it is written, 'and he shall rule upon his throne'; and Joshua is anointed, for he is high priest. And it is written: 'and the counsel of peace shall be between them both,' and they shall not envy one another."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:58.814632390Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}